COMMENT ON COLUMN CRIME."DATE" IS 'Date of the occurrence of the incident being reported';
COMMENT ON COLUMN CRIME."BLOCK" IS 'A redacted address indicating in which city block the incident occurred';
COMMENT ON COLUMN CRIME.IUCR_NO IS 'Illinois Uniform Crime Reporting code: a four digit code used to classify criminal incidents when taking reports.';
