COMMENT ON COLUMN CRIME.FBI_CODE_NO IS 'A code identifying the type of crime reported according to the classification scheme used by the FBI.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN CRIME.LATITUDE IS 'The latitude where incident is reported to have occurred.';
